# ISSUE_395: legacy-peer-deps=true used to be required here because
# react-leaflet@5 (and @react-leaflet/core@3) declared react/react-dom
# ^19.0.0 while this project is on React 18. #225 replaced the Leaflet map
# with react-simple-maps (React 16.8–19 compatible), and `npm install
# --legacy-peer-deps=false` then installed clean with no other conflicts —
# so the override is gone. Kept as an empty file: web/Dockerfile's
# `COPY package*.json .npmrc ./` expects it to exist.
